# Technical Plan — Scribble Lab

> Fully implemented. All scenarios are complete. See commit history for traceability.

## State Model

### Backend (`Room`)
```typescript
interface Room {
  code: string;
  status: "lobby" | "playing" | "result";
  hostId: string;
  participants: Participant[];
  drawerId: string | null;
  secretWord: string | null;
  guesses: Guess[];
  scores: Record<string, number>;  // participantId -> score
  canvasData: string | null;       // base64 or serialized drawing
  createdAt: string;
  updatedAt: string;
}
```

### Frontend (`RoomSnapshot`)
```typescript
interface RoomSnapshot {
  code: string;
  status: "lobby" | "playing" | "result";
  hostId: string;
  participants: Participant[];
  drawerId: string | null;
  secretWord: string;  // empty string for non-drawers
  guesses: Guess[];
  scores: Record<string, number>;
  canvasData: string | null;
  availableWords: string[];
  roles: ParticipantRole[];
}
```

## Data Flow

### Lobby Polling
```
Frontend → GET /rooms/:code?participantId=xxx → Backend → Room snapshot
Frontend ← 200 { room: RoomSnapshot }
Frontend updates store → UI re-renders
```

### Start Game
```
Frontend → POST /rooms/:code/start { participantId } → Backend
Backend validates: is host? ≥2 players?
Backend assigns drawer, selects word, sets status=playing
Frontend ← 200 { room: RoomSnapshot }
Frontend navigates to /game
```

### Drawing
```
Frontend (drawer) → POST /rooms/:code/draw { participantId, canvasData } → Backend
Frontend ← 200 { room: RoomSnapshot }
All players poll GET /rooms/:code to get updated canvasData
```

### Guess Submission
```
Frontend (guesser) → POST /rooms/:code/guess { participantId, text } → Backend
Backend validates: trim, not empty, case-insensitive compare
Backend adds guess to history, updates score if correct
If correct guess, set status=result
Frontend ← 200 { room: RoomSnapshot }
```

### Result & Restart
```
Frontend (host) → POST /rooms/:code/restart { participantId } → Backend
Backend validates: is host?
Backend resets round state, sets status=lobby
Frontend ← 200 { room: RoomSnapshot }
Frontend navigates to /lobby
```

